BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.69 541.89 Tm (lens switcher on both iOS and Android.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 523.89 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.69 523.89 Tm (`init` supports `analyticsEnabled`, `sentryEnabled`, `sentryDsn` for controlling SDK) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.69 509.89 Tm (analytics and crash reporting.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 491.89 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.69 491.89 Tm (Tightened default quality validation thresholds \(blur, glare, perspective\) across) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.69 477.89 Tm (both platforms.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 459.89 Tm (### v1.1.9) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 439.89 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.69 439.89 Tm (Init and per-session routing use `taskUUID`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 421.89 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.69 421.89 Tm (Native detector/model warmup is enforced in `init` and guarded in `openCamera`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 403.89 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.69 403.89 Tm (`openCamera` can return `MODEL_INIT_FAILED` when native model initialization fails.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 385.89 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.69 385.89 Tm (`autoCloseAfterCapture=true` now keeps preview enabled and closes after Save) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.69 371.89 Tm (confirmation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 353.89 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.69 353.89 Tm (Manual finish \(`Done`\) is available when `autoCloseAfterCapture=false` and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.69 339.89 Tm (`allowManualFinish=true`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 321.89 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.69 321.89 Tm (`cameraClosed` event now includes `message`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 303.89 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.69 303.89 Tm (`captureQueued` events are deferred while camera is open and flushed after) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.69 289.89 Tm (`cameraClosed`.) Tj ET
